        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "right side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>my master the Elder Ab\u016b Zik[r\u012b]</li>\n<li>one half qin\u1e6d\u0101r (50 pounds) of bread</li>\n<li>R. Yesh[u]\u02bfa 10 p[o]unds</li>\n<li>the Elder Abu\u02be-F[ara]j [. . .]</li>\n<li>Ya\u02bfq\u016bb 1/2 Munajj\u0101 1 [. . .]</li>\n<li>and his brother 1/2 Ibrah\u012bm b. al-Maw\u0101z\u012bn\u012b (son of the maker of scales) 1/2</li>\n<li>my mast[er t]he Elder Ab\u016b Sa\u02bfd 4 dir(hems)</li>\n<li>Sa[sso]n 10 the teacher [. . .] 1/2</li>\n<li>b. Mard\u016bk 1 b. al-\u1e24azzan (the son of the cantor) 1/2 the Kohen \u1e62adaqa 1</li>\n<li>my uncle 3 pounds</li>\n<li>Musallam 1/2 two sons 1 Ma\u1e25f\u016b\u1e93 1/2</li>\n<li>the [oi]l-makers 1 the Elder Ab\u016b \u02bfAl\u012b 2</li>\n<li>the Karaite 1/2 the Elder Ab[\u016b . . .]RB 1</li>\n<li>R. Yeshu\u02bfa [t]he [. . .] 10 the Elde[r]</li>\n<li>Abu\u02be-[. . .] 1/2 the Elder</li>\n<li>[t]he [Elder . . . from theM]aghreb</li>\n<li>[. . . A]vraham 1</li></ol>\n",
